WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.337
Awareness comes in levels.

00:00:02.387 --> 00:00:04.719
Prompted, you recognise the name.

00:00:04.769 --> 00:00:07.231
Unprompted, you name it unaided.

00:00:07.281 --> 00:00:10.114
Top of mind, it comes out first.

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:13.734
A researcher asks, name a children's charity.

00:00:13.784 --> 00:00:15.384
One person shrugs.

00:00:15.434 --> 00:00:17.731
The other says UNICEF straight away.

00:00:17.781 --> 00:00:19.718
That's top of mind.

00:00:20.433 --> 00:00:23.602
Top-of-mind people had nineteen percent donation intent.

00:00:23.652 --> 00:00:24.982
Prompted only?

00:00:25.032 --> 00:00:26.220
Just seven.

00:00:26.270 --> 00:00:27.983
Nearly triple.

00:00:28.700 --> 00:00:30.112
So track the whole chain,

00:00:30.162 --> 00:00:31.209
from ad awareness,

00:00:31.259 --> 00:00:32.589
to unprompted awareness,

00:00:32.639 --> 00:00:33.439
to intent,

00:00:33.441 --> 00:00:35.954
and finally to market share.
